    "quickAnswer": "Migrate by boundary and risk, tightening compiler flags incrementally while prohibiting new unsafe code. Harden external inputs and critical contracts before polishing low-risk internals.",
    "conceptualExplanation": "Treat external values as `unknown`, add runtime schemas, annotate public APIs, remove `any`, and enable stricter checks in stages with behavioral tests.",
